8e", "idList": "640643a3fd8f3ca308d93195", "desc": "", "pos": 86016.88964655995, "closed": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": [], "idShort": 200, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/73mSuoPq/200-expenses", "dateLastActivity": "2023-09-27T20:58:48Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/215", "field": "idBoard", "value": "640643a3fd8f3ca308d9318e", "record": {"id": "65149770698e71b9b9260c93", "name": "Analytics pipeline", "idBoard": "640643a3fd8f3ca308d9318e", "idList": "641359135e6148b9de0e076c", "desc": "or analytics pipeline here is what I\u2019m thinking\n\n- event collection - Firebase (already the plan)\n- database - redshift to start with before alpha - keep things simple, during alpha we also try out clickhouse in parallel - I\u2019ve heard great things about it\n- data transformation/governance - dbt\n- data visualization - Metabase\n\nI don\u2019t want to spend $30K on Looker for visualization right now (plus I have to learn it or hire someone who is good at Looker) and when [PRODUCT_1051] doesn\u2019t solve our complex needs we can always upgrade to something else.\u00a0(edited)\n\n\u200c\n\nMetabase is sql based and both [PERSON_NAME_0054] and I are (or at least used to be) pretty decent on SQL\n\nI\u2019d rather an analyst with advanced SQL skills with some good sense of analysis than spending money to make life easy for unskillful analysts [USERNAME_4768]", "pos": 1536.0, "closed": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": []